663	        /* XXX eventually I'd like to have this based on processes instead of services.
664	         * That is, if we try to start two services in a row both running in the same
665	         * process, this should be one entry in mStartingBackground for that one process
666	         * that remains until all services in it are done.
667	        final ArrayMap<ProcessRecord, DelayingProcess> mStartingBackgroundMap
