3278	     * Callback from NotificationManagerService whenever it posts a notification
3279	     * associated with a foreground service.  This is the unified handling point
3280	     * for the disjoint code flows that affect an FGS's notifiation content and
3281	     * visibility, starting with both Service.startForeground() and
3282	     * NotificationManager.notify().
